<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33502" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palmĕus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A hand'sbreadth</i>, or <i>palm</i>,
				<i>in length</i>, <i>width</i>,
			etc.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orchis herba, caule palmeo, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					26, 10, 62, § 95</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Of</i> or <i>made of palms</i>, <i>palm-</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tabulae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					10, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tegetes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 5,
					15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 17, 40, § 79</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sporta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 3, 27</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
